      "text": "in the vine were three branches, Gen. 40:10. branches run over the wall, Gen. 49:22. shall the branch of the Lord be beautiful, Isa. 4:2 (2 Ne. 14:2). Jesse, and a Branch shall grow out of his roots, Isa. 11:1 (2 Ne. 21:1). the branch of the terrible ones, Isa. 25:5. the branch of my planting, Isa. 60:21. raise unto David a righteous Branch, Jer. 23:5 (33:15). I will also take of the highest branch, Ezek. 17:22. mountains … shall shoot forth your branches, Ezek. 36:8. His branches shall spread, Hosea 14:6. I will bring forth my servant the Branch, Zech. 3:8. Behold the man whose name is The Branch, Zech. 6:12. leave them neither root nor branch, Mal. 4:1 (3 Ne. 25:1).",
